msgid ""
"Use the override receivable type from rent in automatic invoices, if it is "
"present. When creating a rent, some service units (such as KAMA and KuVa) "
"want to select a receivable type to be used in future automatic invoices. "
"This helps avoid some technical difficulties in invoice XML generation. "
"Generation logic would otherwise be unaware of the desired receivable type, "
"if it is different from the service unit's default receivable type, or the "
"leasetype's receivable type."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan jenis piutang pengganti dari sewa pada tagihan otomatis jika ada. "
"Saat membuat sewa, sebagian unit layanan ingin memilih jenis piutang untuk "
"tagihan otomatis berikutnya, yang mungkin berbeda dari jenis piutang bawaan "
"unit layanan atau jenis sewa."

